#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:4
msgid ""
"By selecting multiple cells at once, common operations can be performed on "
"all the cells which have been selected. These operations include data entry,"
" copying the cells, and multiple other operations ."
msgstr ""
"När du markerar flera celler samtidigt kan du utföra vanliga åtgärder på dem"
" alla, till exempel mata in data, kopiera celler och göra flera andra saker."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:12
msgid ""
"Some operations cannot be done on selections of arbitrary shape. For "
"instance, <application>Gnumeric</application> could not correctly reshape a "
"worksheet following the deletion of a discontinuous group of cells therefore"
" such an operation is not allowed. If users attempt an operation which "
"cannot be performed, a warning dialog will appear."
msgstr ""
"Vissa åtgärder kan inte utföras på markeringar med godtycklig form. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan till exempel inte omforma ett "
"kalkylblad korrekt om en icke-sammanhängande grupp celler tas bort. Därför "
"tillåts inte en sådan åtgärd. Om du försöker utföra en åtgärd som inte stöds"
" visas en varningsdialogruta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:26
msgid ""
"The simplest selection involves a single cell. In most cases, simply "
"clicking with the left hand mouse button while the mouse cursor is over a "
"cell will cause that cell to become selected."
msgstr ""
"Den enklaste markeringen består av en enda cell. Vanligtvis markerar du en "
"cell genom att klicka på den med vänster musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:32
msgid ""
"The selected cell is indicated by a dark double line with a small square in "
"the bottom right corner. The selected cell is the one that is currently in "
"focus and will take any input for the keyboard."
msgstr ""
"Den markerade cellen ramas in av en mörk dubbel linje med en liten ruta "
"längst ned till höger. Cellen som har fokus tar emot tangentbordsinmatning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:42
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of a single "
"selected cell.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-2.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en enskild "
"markerad cell.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:53
msgid ""
"To make a cell become the selected cell, simply move the white-cross cursor "
"over the cell and press the left mouse button. There is one exception: When "
"on a cell that contains a hyperlink, the mouse cursor changes from the white"
" cross to a hand and clicking the left mouse button activates the link. In "
"that case the cell can be selected by clicking the middle mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Flytta pekaren med det vita korset över cellen och klicka med vänster "
"musknapp för att markera den. Ett undantag finns: om cellen innehåller en "
"hyperlänk ändras pekaren i stället till en hand, och ett vänsterklick öppnar"
" länken. Då kan du markera cellen genom att klicka med mittenknappen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:66
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the cursor "
"selecting a cell.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-1.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av pekaren när "
"den markerar en cell.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:83
msgid ""
"Several cells can be selected at once. When multiple cells are selected, the"
" selected cells are indicated with a light, \"baby\" blue colour. When a "
"single block of cells is selected, a double black line will surround the "
"selection, and all cells except the first one to be selected will be shown "
"in light blue."
msgstr ""
"Du kan markera flera celler samtidigt. De markerade cellerna visas då i "
"ljusblått. Ett sammanhängande cellområde omges av en dubbel svart linje, och"
" alla celler utom den först markerade visas i ljusblått."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:94
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-3.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of a "
"contiguous selection of cells.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-3.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av ett "
"sammanhängande markerat cellområde.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:109
msgid ""
"To make a continuous selection of cells, move the white cross mouse cursor "
"pointer to the cell at one corner of the block of continuous cells, click "
"and hold the primary mouse pointer on that cell, drag the pointer to the "
"opposite corner of the block of cells and then release the mouse button. The"
" block of cells will now be selected."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill markera ett sammanhängande cellområde flyttar du pekaren med det "
"vita korset till ett av områdets hörn. Håll ned musknappen, dra pekaren till"
" det motsatta hörnet och släpp knappen. Cellerna i området markeras då."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:118
msgid ""
"The arrow keys can also be used to select a continuous block of cells. To "
"add cells in this manner, first select the cell in one corner of the cell "
"block with the primary mouse button, then hold the <keycap>Shift</keycap> "
"key and use the arrow keys to expand the selection block."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också markera ett sammanhängande cellområde med piltangenterna. "
"Markera först en cell i ett av områdets hörn med musknappen. Håll sedan ned "
"<keycap>Shift</keycap> och använd piltangenterna för att utöka markeringen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:129
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-4.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of a block "
"selection and the mouse cursor.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-4.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av ett markerat"
" cellområde och muspekaren.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:146
msgid ""
"A discontinuous group of cells can also be selected, by selecting cells or "
"block of cells while holding down the <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> key. To select a"
" discontinuous group of cells, first select a cell or a continuous group of "
"cells as explained above, then click and hold down the <keycap>Ctrl</keycap>"
" while selecting more cells. All of the cells which are selected while the "
"<keycap>Ctrl</keycap> key is held down will be added to the selection. All "
"selected cells will be displayed with a light blue colour. Cells can be "
"added individually or as continuous blocks. This selection process is "
"additive with each selected cell added only once so selecting cells twice or"
" more simply adds those cells once to the selection."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också markera en icke-sammanhängande grupp celler genom att hålla ned"
" <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> medan du markerar enskilda celler eller cellområden. "
"Markera först en cell eller ett sammanhängande område enligt beskrivningen "
"ovan. Håll sedan ned <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> medan du markerar fler celler. "
"Alla celler du markerar medan <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> hålls ned läggs till i "
"den befintliga markeringen och visas i ljusblått. Du kan lägga till celler "
"en och en eller som sammanhängande områden. Varje cell läggs bara till en "
"gång, även om du markerar den flera gånger."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:164
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-5.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of a multiple "
"selection.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/selection-5.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av flera "
"markerade cellområden.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:181
msgid ""
"There are several ways to make selections using the keyboard keys directly. "
"These may be quicker than using the mouse pointer. As explained above, the "
"simplest of these uses the <keycap>Shift</keycap> and <keycap>arrow</keycap>"
" keys to make a new selection."
msgstr ""
"Du kan markera celler på flera sätt direkt med tangentbordet, vilket ibland "
"går snabbare än att använda musen. Det enklaste sättet är att använda "
"<keycap>Shift</keycap> och <keycap>piltangent</keycap> för att skapa en ny "
"markering, enligt beskrivningen ovan."
